---
/* ============================================================================
   Arrow.astro: the site's one link arrow.
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The "Let's build it." arrow (round 6), made reusable on 2026-09-28 at his
   request so every link on the site ends the same way. Two copies of the
   up-right arrow in one clipped box: on hover or keyboard focus of the parent
   link, the first flies out top-right and the second flies in from
   bottom-left. Styles live in v3.css (.v3-arrow), because Icon.astro's
   set:html SVGs carry no Astro scope attribute. Decorative: the link's text
   names it.
   ========================================================================= */
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<span class="v3-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
  <Icon name="arrow-up-right" class="v3-arrow__a" />
  <Icon name="arrow-up-right" class="v3-arrow__b" />
</span>
